{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Kitty or her friends and survive the wave of cat nightmares in this roguelite survivor.\u00a0The cat automatically throws its toys at enemies; all you have to do is control its path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/a10aaf75f8ddaf80d283882f5d8fc138.poster.avif?t=1766071489\" width=704 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/a10aaf75f8ddaf80d283882f5d8fc138.webm?t=1766071489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/a10aaf75f8ddaf80d283882f5d8fc138.mp4?t=1766071489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/0650cb168accd3f7c15f6d82eefd2f83.webp?t=1766071489\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll unlock an array of hilarious yet powerful cat-based weaponry that evolves with you. Each weapon starts as a playful toy and transforms into more impressive and dangerous forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/122ef6bf2a02111f6c114d06cb78e52a.poster.avif?t=1766071489\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/122ef6bf2a02111f6c114d06cb78e52a.webm?t=1766071489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/122ef6bf2a02111f6c114d06cb78e52a.mp4?t=1766071489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/509298fa12c174b9c705eba2e0966698.webp?t=1766071489\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon you acquire is associated with one or more families, each offering distinct bonuses that amplify with every point in it. Will you be a playful cat dropping cute ball, or a nasty one throwing poop at your enemies? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/c2ab2753b8cd3f039909578f4a46e448.poster.avif?t=1766071489\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/c2ab2753b8cd3f039909578f4a46e448.webm?t=1766071489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/c2ab2753b8cd3f039909578f4a46e448.mp4?t=1766071489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/ac9c9601474ff6ee1ddd9abcb7351f5d.webp?t=1766071489\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control one of the different cats, each with its characteristics and starting weapon!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/45e9d7ad89110fe9c78260bfe26bcefd.poster.avif?t=1766071489\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/45e9d7ad89110fe9c78260bfe26bcefd.webm?t=1766071489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/45e9d7ad89110fe9c78260bfe26bcefd.mp4?t=1766071489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/ff05e2b452cd1251c622eea9a1e49883.webp?t=1766071489\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each run, you can purchase permanent upgrades or new cats to play with!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/017fbece7de5961ecde732d1c95ee442.avif?t=1766071489\" width=762 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/5a8c53826aedddd8d7094aa7d9234937.webp?t=1766071489\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire world unfolds within a book created by Kitty's grieving human so she can experience one last adventure. This book contains multiple worlds to explore, each representing a stage of grief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/7bb70fdfcff5117be0ece40f0033f4a5.webp?t=1766071489\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am Woum, a one-man army that did everything except the game's sound design! This is my second game on Steam and I really hope you will enjoy this game I made with love \ud83d\udc95</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Unlock Tao","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778500/fede2d9c61d49483e6f7618f0e0c9806ed943ce9.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Rocky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778500/d3ff353299155c4e1e9c9c6cf70af97803fd3460.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Noxy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778500/d749f49d1e30eee1c546f292d738dad4e09ad7b1.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Gizmo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778500/c83c31d8b9593173cbbabbf9039269eb981d4495.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Challenge Mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778500/f760190646370f6ecfe38334b03456e44b472055.jpg"},{"name":"Your first CatCoin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778500/f268b30016fb8f589dc6767206ec074fc08dc215.jpg"},{"name":"It Hurts!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778500/3fb7910284c4fef59366da95f80d2418afef3988.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock SpooKitty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778500/4e571de9118ef5ef0b58903e53929340cd5d6d3d.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Skeletty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778500/d0909e86de5e58e76789f85e275bb9df27f47253.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock WildCat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778500/b0a93264849f58d64401c42ea19d1d17f8f5b315.jpg"}],"total":72},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2778500?t=1766071489","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766071489","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/f4431f110c3a8d7ec3a6a383c105fada7a03d3ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766071489","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/f4431f110c3a8d7ec3a6a383c105fada7a03d3ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766071489","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Kitty or her friends and survive the wave of cat nightmares in this roguelite survivor.\u00a0The cat automatically throws its toys at enemies; all you have to do is control its path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/a10aaf75f8ddaf80d283882f5d8fc138.poster.avif?t=1766071489\" width=704 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/a10aaf75f8ddaf80d283882f5d8fc138.webm?t=1766071489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/a10aaf75f8ddaf80d283882f5d8fc138.mp4?t=1766071489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/0650cb168accd3f7c15f6d82eefd2f83.webp?t=1766071489\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll unlock an array of hilarious yet powerful cat-based weaponry that evolves with you. Each weapon starts as a playful toy and transforms into more impressive and dangerous forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/122ef6bf2a02111f6c114d06cb78e52a.poster.avif?t=1766071489\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/122ef6bf2a02111f6c114d06cb78e52a.webm?t=1766071489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/122ef6bf2a02111f6c114d06cb78e52a.mp4?t=1766071489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/509298fa12c174b9c705eba2e0966698.webp?t=1766071489\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon you acquire is associated with one or more families, each offering distinct bonuses that amplify with every point in it. Will you be a playful cat dropping cute ball, or a nasty one throwing poop at your enemies? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/c2ab2753b8cd3f039909578f4a46e448.poster.avif?t=1766071489\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/c2ab2753b8cd3f039909578f4a46e448.webm?t=1766071489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/c2ab2753b8cd3f039909578f4a46e448.mp4?t=1766071489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/ac9c9601474ff6ee1ddd9abcb7351f5d.webp?t=1766071489\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control one of the different cats, each with its characteristics and starting weapon!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/45e9d7ad89110fe9c78260bfe26bcefd.poster.avif?t=1766071489\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/45e9d7ad89110fe9c78260bfe26bcefd.webm?t=1766071489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/45e9d7ad89110fe9c78260bfe26bcefd.mp4?t=1766071489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/ff05e2b452cd1251c622eea9a1e49883.webp?t=1766071489\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each run, you can purchase permanent upgrades or new cats to play with!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/017fbece7de5961ecde732d1c95ee442.avif?t=1766071489\" width=762 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/5a8c53826aedddd8d7094aa7d9234937.webp?t=1766071489\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire world unfolds within a book created by Kitty's grieving human so she can experience one last adventure. This book contains multiple worlds to explore, each representing a stage of grief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/extras/7bb70fdfcff5117be0ece40f0033f4a5.webp?t=1766071489\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am Woum, a one-man army that did everything except the game's sound design! This is my second game on Steam and I really hope you will enjoy this game I made with love \ud83d\udc95</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Woum"],"dlc":[3587360],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778500/4f0455a66e583a28952a81630285309a75fff5bc/header.jpg?t=1766071489","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Mac 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"name":"Kitty's Last Adventure","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Kitty's Last Adventure - $4.99 USD","packageid":992998,"percent_savings":0,"p